      "message": "[warning] Line 516: 🟡 Selection anchors are not preserved for backward selections. Sending `editor.selectionStart` as the anchor works only when the caret is at `selectionEnd`; if the user selects text right-to-left, both `cursorPosition` and `selectionStart` can be the same value, so peers receive a collapsed/incorrect selection. Send the opposite endpoint, e.g. `editor.cursorPosition \u003d\u003d\u003d editor.selectionStart ? editor.selectionEnd : editor.selectionStart`.",
      "revId": "5a44e3048cdbf9a2c1f59199e8fd2374609a32e9",
